Z||000009||bHooper||02-26-2000||08:47 PM||||hey, this is F1... there was no way i am going to miss a race in the states!  as for the ticket, if i have one available, it's yours for face value... no scalping here!  <P>my goal for this year is to go to a sportscar race (or two), the F1 event, and possibly the MidOhio CART race.  <P>i love NC, but it really sucks to live hear and like better forms of racing!<P>on the other hand, they are about to reopen Virginia International Raceway (yes, it is a road course!), as a country club/scca type thing.... think i'll be visiting that often, once i get my car in decent shape!||||reg||1
